          <Pad Id="JON2PdBlyapMgteVQFVnvs" Comment="text" Bounds="335,1671,435,181" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="# Hi there! 👋&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Thanks for reaching out! I see you've sent &quot;123&quot; — I'm ready to help with whatever you need.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Since you mentioned I should focus on plain text/Markdown responses without using most tools, just let me know what you'd like assistance with. Whether it's:&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;- Answering questions&#xD;&#xA;- Brainstorming ideas&#xD;&#xA;- Writing or editing content&#xD;&#xA;- Explaining concepts&#xD;&#xA;- Problem-solving&#xD;&#xA;- Or anything else&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;I'm here to help! What can I do for you?">
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">5</p:fontsize>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="KHRglS343wiP6gR0ZwmIoI" Comment="chunk" Bounds="390,1933,240,159" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value=", and I'll do my best to assist!" />
